-- #anchor-wiring (2026-08-14, 오너 확정): 앵커별 실측 검증 절 배선.
-- 12종 배터리(dev/Image_Style/*-test.md ×12)의 확정 — 전 앵커 B(검증 절), watercolor 만 A(preview
-- 2번 스타일 레퍼런스), jp_melo 는 C(룩+매체 절 세트, 테스트된 원문 그대로 — bloom 유지).
-- euro_period·psy_horror 는 절 NULL = T 유지 (B 절이 실측 해악: 촛대 삽입·주간 파괴 — 켜려면
-- style_clause 만 채우면 됨). anchor_kind 는 Rule 6(서브룩 그레이드 권위) 분기용.
-- 절 정본은 이 백필값이며 코드가 아니라 DB 가 진실. 적용: supabase db query --linked, 문장 개별
-- 실행(반드시 저장소 루트에서 — 링크 컨텍스트 밖이면 'Cannot find project ref' 로 조용히 실패).
-- 2026-08-14 적용 완료.

alter table public.style_anchors add column if not exists style_clause text;alter table public.style_anchors add column if not exists use_preview_ref boolean not null default false;alter table public.style_anchors add column if not exists anchor_kind text not null default 'media';update style_anchors set anchor_kind='sublook' where key in ('real_desert_fantasy','real_euro_period','real_hitech_sf','real_jp_melo','real_psy_horror','real_urban_hero');update style_anchors set style_clause='Carry the style reference''s scene language as well: its color energy, its pattern and decoration language, its density of set dressing and background detail, and the way it stages depth.' where key='real_3d';update style_anchors set style_clause='Carry the style reference''s scene language as well: its color energy, its pattern and decoration language, its density of set dressing and background detail, and the way it stages depth.' where key='real';update style_anchors set style_clause='Carry how the style reference draws figures. Any figures are drawn in flat television-cartoon proportions, roughly five and a half heads tall, with simplified tubular limbs and small simple hands; large round white eyes with a small dark round pupil and a thin dark upper lid line, no visible iris coloring and no eyelashes; a small simple curved nose with no nostrils and a simple mouth drawn as one outlined shape; hair reads as one solid flat color mass with a few pointed clumps at the silhouette; skin and garments are filled with flat unmodulated color, shaded with at most one darker step, and every form is bounded by a heavy black contour of even weight.' where key='us_cartoon';update style_anchors set style_clause='Carry how the style reference draws figures. Any figures have slender naturalistic animated proportions, about seven and a half heads tall, with long limbs and small refined hands; tall almond eyes with a thick dark upper lash line drawn as one solid band, a dark iris carrying one small bright highlight and a lighter lower half, and no hard eyeliner beyond the lash band; a tiny sharp nose indicated by a short stroke and a small simply drawn mouth; hair is drawn as a few large clumps breaking into pointed strand tips; skin and cloth are cel shaded with one soft-edged shadow tone in a cool violet-blue, and shapes are held by thin colored outlines rather than heavy black ink.' where key='jp_anime';update style_anchors set style_clause='Everything is rendered as handmade stop-motion photography of a physical tabletop miniature set. Any figures are handmade physical puppets built from needle-felted wool and sculpted clay over an armature - matte felted-fibre skin, wool-roving hair, real miniature knitted and felted fabric with visible fibre, seams and fraying, and small glossy bead eyes set into the sculpted face. Not a drawing, and not a live-action photograph of real people.' where key='stop_motion';update style_anchors set style_clause='LOOK - render this in a bold modern big-city blockbuster look: mixed metropolitan light with several differently colored light sources in the same frame, medium-high contrast with open, information-rich shadows that stay full of bounced detail instead of crushing to black, a high-saturation palette in which vivid saturated colors sit against desaturated concrete, glass and asphalt, punchy clarity and crisp HDR-like micro-contrast holding detail in both highlights and shadows, and a sense of monumental big-city scale.' where key='real_urban_hero';update style_anchors set style_clause='Render it in this look: cool clinical lighting around 7000K, very high contrast, with clean, sharp-edged, precise shadows. A restrained cool near-monochrome palette of greys and blue-blacks carrying only a few controlled high-saturation electric cyan accents. Metal reads as flawless high-polish chrome; glass is precision-cut with a faint luminous edge-lit glow; fabric is fine woven technical performance material. Ultra-sharp detail. Do not add a city skyline or distant cityscape unless the scene itself calls for one.' where key='real_hitech_sf';update style_anchors set style_clause='Render this as a finished example of that look applied to a whole shot - a sun-bleached desert grade: a low-saturation palette of sand, ochre, bone and pale dust-grey with no clean or vivid color anywhere in it; hard, low, raking key light that carves hot, heavy, sharp-edged shadows and bleaches its highlights; fine airborne dust hanging in every beam of light and a pale haze swallowing the far distance; gritty porous weathered stone, dust-filmed thick glass, pitted patinated brass and coarse rough-woven linen wherever such materials appear; monumental scale, heavy grain, a filmic grade, and a mood of solemn grandeur. This is a color, light and material treatment only - keep the scene exactly as described, with its own stated time of day and light source, and do not relocate it or add desert scenery. Expose it high-key and bright: the whole frame is light, pale and sun-washed, with a luminous pale haze, only a few small deep shadows, and no large dark areas anywhere in the frame.' where key='real_desert_fantasy';update style_anchors set style_clause='Grade the whole image in this look: soft diffuse light, low contrast, with soft, bright, gently lifted shadows; a muted low-to-medium saturation pastel palette; delicate romantic bloom and halation on the highlights; fine soft film grain. Mood: a tender, wistful flutter. Rendered in photorealistic live-action cinematography, shot on a digital cinema camera with a 35mm lens - true-to-life skin texture with visible pores, real fabric weave and true material response. A real photograph, not an illustration, painting or anime.' where key='real_jp_melo';update style_anchors set style_clause='Carry HOW the style references render scenes and figures: the watercolor medium, its washes, pigment blooms and paper texture, its figure proportions and facial shape language. Do NOT reproduce their subjects, characters, places or props.' where key='watercolor';update style_anchors set use_preview_ref=true where key='watercolor';update style_anchors set style_clause=null where key in ('real_euro_period','real_psy_horror');
